<view class="page">
  <view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title"><view class="top-title-main">安全建议</view><view class="top-title-sub">已完成判断</view></view></view>
  <view class="card result-hero"><view class="score-ring" style="border-color:{{info.color}}"><image class="figma-icon lg" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-imgFrame1.svg"/></view><view class="h1" style="font-size:52rpx">{{info.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{info.sub}}</view></view>
  <view class="h2" style="margin:54rpx 0 24rpx">现在先做这 3 步</view>
  <view class="stack gap-8"><view class="field"><view class="circle circle-green step">1</view><view><view>清洁接触处</view><view class="tiny">使用清水和温和清洁用品</view></view><image class="figma-icon sm" style="margin-left:auto" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-imgEllipse5.svg"/></view><view class="field"><view class="circle circle-green step">2</view><view><view>冷敷 10–15 分钟</view><view class="tiny">隔布冷敷，避免抓挠</view></view><image class="figma-icon sm" style="margin-left:auto" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-imgEllipse5.svg"/></view><view class="field"><view class="circle circle-green step">3</view><view><view>记录红肿边界</view><view class="tiny">便于复查时比较变化</view></view><image class="figma-icon sm" style="margin-left:auto" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-imgEllipse5.svg"/></view></view>
  <view class="notice notice-red" style="margin-top:48rpx"><view class="circle circle-red" style="width:72rpx;height:72rpx"><image class="figma-icon md" src="/assets/figma/all/s07-img1.svg"/></view><view>呼吸困难、意识异常或快速扩散<text class="block-break"></text>立即停止观察并进入紧急求助</view></view>
  <view class="card card-pad row" style="margin-top:32rpx"><view class="circle circle-green" style="width:72rpx;height:72rpx">2h</view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:22rpx"><view>已安排复查 · {{level==='observe'?'2 小时后':'尽快'}}</view><view class="tiny">届时只需更新变化，即可重新评估</view></view><text class="muted">调整</text></view>
  <button class="{{level==='emergency'?'danger-btn':'primary-btn'}}" style="margin-top:42rpx" bindtap="primaryAction">{{primaryActionLabel}}</button>
  <view class="result-secondary"><text wx:if="{{allowStepBack}}" bindtap="modifyAnswers">修改本次回答</text><text wx:if="{{level!=='observe'}}" bindtap="events">查看事件记录</text><text bindtap="home">返回首页</text></view>
  <view class="between tiny" style="margin-top:26rpx"><text>事件已自动保存</text><view class="row" bindtap="events"><text>编号 {{eventId}}</text></view></view><view class="safe-note" style="margin-top:24rpx">结果为安全分流建议，不构成医疗诊断</view>
</view>
